        <mxCell id="c67" value='• a Taskflow &lt;b&gt;subflow&lt;/b&gt; of twelve checks:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;shape of versions, anchors, hashes (panel&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;B)&lt;br&gt;• then &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;compile_for_validation&lt;/font&gt; =&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;cpp2post_cpp::translate&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;• checks the file as it is. The Wizard&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;command is checked later, by the Wizard&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;step&lt;br&gt;• prints lang-parsed.xml' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cfcfcf;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="732" width="300" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
