        <mxCell id="c402" value='• Seven checks (the four root checks, &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;is anonymous versions owned&lt;/font&gt;, both hash checks) do &lt;b&gt;nothing&lt;/b&gt; when the Wizard command is, or contains, &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;create root aggregate&lt;/font&gt;: the root does not exist yet.&lt;br&gt;• A hash of a version named by &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;create hash … force&lt;/font&gt; or &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;delete hash … force&lt;/font&gt; is not checked in this run.&lt;br&gt;• A failure is thrown on a worker: &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;fail(code, what, where)&lt;/font&gt; runs &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;augment_where&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;inside&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;capture_or_rethrow&lt;/font&gt;, and &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;subflow.join()&lt;/font&gt; rethrows on the caller.&lt;br&gt;• Which error is reported first is not deterministic when several checks fail.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;validate_memo_t&lt;/font&gt; caches only the three root gate checks (shared mutex, success only). It is replaced together with the checker (&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;refresh_checks&lt;/font&gt;).&lt;br&gt;• Wizard commands are &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; in this graph. The Wizard step calls &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;may_execute_wizard_command()&lt;/font&gt; itself (panel C).' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#cccccc;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2610" y="2198" width="2460" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c513" value="C  The Wizard step" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#bdbdbd;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#222222;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2378" width="2500" height="602" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c405" value='&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;cpp2cpp_wizard::translate&lt;/font&gt; works &lt;b&gt;in place&lt;/b&gt; on the language graph, through the same &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;builder_t&lt;/font&gt; that the parser uses. There is no dry run: the checks run on the real graph right&lt;br&gt;before each change.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#444444;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="2422" width="1180" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c406" value='&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;translate()&lt;/font&gt;: no Wizard statement → return the graph unchanged' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="2478" width="540" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c407" value='&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;validate_-&amp;gt;is_wizard_command_single()&lt;/font&gt;: one statement in the whole graph, not one per&lt;br&gt;file' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="2544" width="540" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c408" value='single command: &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;apply_one(type)&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;— a &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;switch&lt;/font&gt; over &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;command_et&lt;/font&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="2610" width="540" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c409" value='&lt;b&gt;batch&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;apply_wizard_batch&lt;/font&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;may_execute_wizard_command()&lt;/font&gt;: batch context is a chunk&lt;br&gt;• for each item:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;refresh_checks()&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(new memo, new checker, &lt;b&gt;re-snapshot&lt;/b&gt; of aggregates)&lt;br&gt;• overwrite the stored statement: &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;type&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;data&lt;/font&gt; = the item&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;is_wizard_batch_command_create()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;apply_one(item.type)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;• restore the statement' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="2544" width="560" height="115" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c410" value='&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;apply_*&lt;/font&gt; begin with &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;validate_-&amp;gt;may_execute_wizard_command()&lt;/font&gt;, then change the graph with&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;builder_t&lt;/font&gt; (vertices get &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;created_by_wizard = true&lt;/font&gt;) and call &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;refresh_live_and_hashed()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;after structural edits' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="2686" width="540" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c411" value='&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;comment_executed_command()&lt;/font&gt;: the statement text becomes &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;//&lt;/font&gt; lines at the top of its&lt;br&gt;chunk. &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;cpp2gal&lt;/font&gt; prints only comments, never the command' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="2780" width="540" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c412" value="" style="html=1;rounded=1;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="c406" target="c407"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c413" value="" style="html=1;rounded=1;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="c407" target="c408"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c414" value="batch" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=1;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="c407" target="c409"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c415" value="" style="html=1;rounded=1;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="c408" target="c410"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c416" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=1;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="c409" target="c410"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c417" value="" style="html=1;rounded=1;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="c410" target="c411"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c418" value='&lt;b&gt;closed versions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;closed = a root version at or before the last hashed declaration (&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;last_hashed&lt;/font&gt;).&lt;br&gt;The protection is entirely in the validator (&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;wizard-closed-version&lt;/font&gt; rules). The &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;apply_*&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;functions assume it passed, and after any change of hashes or declarations they must&lt;br&gt;refresh &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;last_hashed&lt;/font&gt;, or the next command of a batch sees a stale seal.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="2686" width="560" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c419" value='&lt;b&gt;command → check → change&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(P: the graph changes, H: a &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;delete&lt;/font&gt; is written into the history)' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1310" y="2422" width="1180" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c420" value="command" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f2f2;strokeColor=#cccccc;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1310" y="2456" width="230" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c421" value="" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f2f2;strokeColor=#cccccc;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1544" y="2456" width="40" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c422" value='checked by (&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;cpp2cpp_validate_t&lt;/font&gt;)' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f2f2;strokeColor=#cccccc;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1588" y="2456" width="400" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c423" value='applied by (&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;cpp2cpp_wizard_t&lt;/font&gt;)' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f2f2;strokeColor=#cccccc;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1992" y="2456" width="560" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
